<title>KENYA: SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS' CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS' CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of African Nations' Cup</p>
<p>Qualifiers on Saturday:</p>
<p>Group 5</p>
<p>In Nairobi: Kenya 0 Cameroon 0</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000.</p>
<p>Group 6</p>
<p>In Dar-Es-Salaam: Lone Stars (Liberia) 1 Taifa Stars</p>
<p>(Tanzania) 1 (halftime 1-0).</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Liberia - Jonathan Sogbie 27</p>
<p>Tanzania - Dua Said 75</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000.</p>
<p>Group 7</p>
<p>    In Blantyre: Malawi 2 Mozambique   0  (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: John Maduka 6, Roland Kamanga 60</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000.</p>
<p>Group 3:</p>
<p>In Dakar:  Senegal 0 Morocco 0.</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>Group 5</p>
<p>In Windhoek: Namibia 1 Gabon 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Namibia - Ruben van Wyk (86th min)</p>
<p>Gabon - Pierre Aubame (19th min penalty)</p>
<p>Standings:</p>
<p>    Cameroon 3  1  2  0  4  0  5</p>
<p>    Kenya    3  1  1  1  1  1  4</p>
<p>    Namibia  3  1  1  1  2  5  4</p>
<p>    Gabon    3  0  2  1  1  2  2</p>
</text>
